### ms-vehiculos · Vehículos - pruebas manuales

@auth = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8003

### Obtener token (ms-auth)
# @name login
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Estado del servicio (público)
GET {{host}}/health

### Listado (requiere token)
GET {{host}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token -> 401
GET {{host}}/vehiculos
